<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou as life in me indeed,</l><l>By the law of life dost lead;</l><l>When Thou reignest in Thy might,</l><l>All my darkness turns to light.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Liberating Spirit, Thou,</l><l>Wholly regulate me now;</l><l>Thus my mind Thou wilt renew</l><l>And Thy will I’ll fully know.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
